pasteClipboard [SimTalk] - Frame
Pastes the contents of the clipboard into the Frame designated by <Path>.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.pasteClipboard([TargetTable:table])
Parameter
The optional parameter TargetTable of data type table writes all pasted objects to the specified table after
it executed the method.
The table has one column of data type object.
Example
var tbl: table
var   i: integer
pasteClipboard(tbl)
for var i := 1 to tbl.yDim 
   print tbl[1,i]  // outputs all pasted objects
next
SimTalk
copyObjectsToClipboard [SimTalk]
